plantuml
@startuml
title Phased Spec-Driven Development Workflow (SDD v2.0)

' --- Layout Optimization ---
!pragma useVerticalIf on
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

' High spacing to give lines room to route around boxes
skinparam ranksep 100
skinparam nodesep 120
skinparam wrapWidth 200

' Define Swimlanes
|#GhostWhite|User / Developer|
|#AliceBlue|Spec Writer Agent (Persona)|
|#FloralWhite|Executor Agent (Persona)|

' --- START PROCESS ---
|User / Developer|
start
:Submit Request;

|Spec Writer Agent (Persona)|
:Intent Analysis;

if (Is General Research?) then (yes)
  :Proceed with standard response;
|User / Developer|
  (Z)
  detach
else (no)
  |Spec Writer Agent (Persona)|
  if (Vague Arch Shift OR > 2 Files?) then (yes)
    :Refuse Immediate Coding;
    :Collaborative Interview;
    |User / Developer|
    :Provide Context & Impact Details;
    |Spec Writer Agent (Persona)|
    :Pre-Drafting Standard Review\n(architecture.md, etc.);
    :Create Plan Directory & /memory/;
    :Generate TASK_SPEC.md;
    |User / Developer|
    :Review and Approve Spec;
  else (no)
    |Spec Writer Agent (Persona)|
    :Standard One-off Plan;
    |User / Developer|
    :Approve Plan;
  endif
endif

|Executor Agent (Persona)|
repeat
  :Read Spec & Check /memory/ findings;
  :Execute Atomic Phase Tasks;
  if (Unexpected Behavior Found?) then (yes)
    :Log to /memory/discovery.md;
  else (no)
  endif
  |User / Developer|
  :Human Gate: Phase Approval;
  |Executor Agent (Persona)|
repeat while (More Phases Remain?) is (yes)
->no;

|User / Developer|
:Final Verification & Sign-off;
(Z)
stop
@enduml